MODE TIDAK VALID


Pola (EN)

Pak Dengklek sets up 4 different types of mathematical sequence patterns on the whiteboard. Pak
Dengklek will provide a sequence type code T and an integer N.
Your task is to calculate the sum of the sequence quickly (without using loops):
●​ If T = 1 (Odd Numbers): Calculate 1 + 3 + 5 + … for N terms.
●​ If T = 2 (Even Numbers): Calculate 2 + 4 + 6 + … for N terms.
●​ If T = 3 (Square Numbers): Calculate 12 + 22 + 32 + … + N2.
●​ If T = 4 (Cubic Numbers): Calculate 13 + 23 + 33 + … + N3.
If the value T is outside the range of 1 to 4, display an error message.
Input
